      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Extended 4 bedroom semi detached house located on north side of Drogheda close to DIFE collage. This well maintained home offers excellent living accommodation which briefly comprises of; entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. Having a double bedroom and bathroom on ground floor an excellent feature. Presented in good condition throughout, this home is an impressive B rating. The house has gas fired central heating, upvc double glazed windows and PV solar panels. Easy access to M1 motorway and Lourdes Hospital. \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 4.18 x 1.80\r\nunder stair storage, coving\r\nSitting room: 3.52 x 3.94\r\nlaminate wood floor, feature fireplace, display unit.\r\nKitchen: 5.45 x 3.06\r\nfrench doors to garden, fitted units, tiled floor & splashback\r\nBathroom 1: 3.09 x 1.6\r\nshower, wc, whb, towel heater, fully tiled\r\nBedroom 4 (ground floor): 3.4 x 2.89\r\nfitted wardrobes, laminate wood floor\r\n1st floor:\r\nBathroom 2: 1.75 x 2.1\r\nbath, wc, whb, tiled bath area\r\nBedroom 1: 3.76 x 3.35\r\nlaminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 2: 3.05 x 3.76\r\nlaminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 3: 2.3 x 2.86\r\nlaminate wood floor, built in raised bed & workstation.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1. Large walled in rear garden\r\n2. Patio area\r\n3. Block built garden shed & steal tec shed\r\n4. Gas heating\r\n5. PV solar panels\r\n6. large front drive\r\n7. Cul de sac location"
      },
      {
